@gw = http://localhost:8080
# Jeton : scripts/token.sh <e-mail> (15 min)
@token = COLLER_LE_JETON_ICI

### Journal (ADMIN_SYSTEME) : filtres combinables
GET {{gw}}/api/audit?service=ms-achats&action=MARCHE_ATTRIBUE&du=2026-10-01&au=2026-10-31&page=0&size=20&sort=occurredAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recherche libre
GET {{gw}}/api/audit?q=BES-2026-0037
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actions d'un utilisateur (Ibrahima Fall)
GET {{gw}}/api/audit?utilisateurId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000201
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Statistiques
GET {{gw}}/api/audit/statistiques
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
